# banshee-714: the jetsam counter only sees the sustained-pressure kill path, so a
# zero must not read as "nothing was killed" (on 2026-09-15 it was 0 while the kernel
# killed ~170 processes via idle-exit rf:high and one per-process-limit). Reverting the
# wording to the bare "no kills this window" is the false reassurance the pin guards.
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/mod.rs
test: the_zero_jetsam_detail_scopes_itself_to_sustained_pressure
---OLD---
                "no sustained-pressure kills this window".to_string()
---NEW---
                "no kills this window".to_string()
